{"problem_id":"6ed9c9e7-b809-4d36-bacf-e3334b226363","source_problem_id":"508963","normalized_content":{"assets":[{"alt":"","url":"/assets/f03f15cd-a8a9-47a9-8c66-c1c4b03c2f99","kind":"ordinary_image","asset_id":"f03f15cd-a8a9-47a9-8c66-c1c4b03c2f99","asset_key":"image_1"}],"format":"teacherhelper-normalized","sections":[{"key":"condition","html":"<p>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+a\"></span>. Най­ди­те, при каком зна­че­нии <i>x</i> зна­че­ние функ­ции равно −17.</p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"f03f15cd-a8a9-47a9-8c66-c1c4b03c2f99\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/f03f15cd-a8a9-47a9-8c66-c1c4b03c2f99\"/>","title":"Условие","asset_keys":["image_1"],"section_id":"condition:1"},{"key":"answer","html":"<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-0,25</span></p>","title":"Ответ","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"answer:1"},{"key":"solution","html":"<p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  −1, зна­чит, <i>a</i>  =  −1. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(1)  =  3, тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{k}{1}-1=3\\iff k=4\"></span>.  Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{4}{x}-1=-17\\iff x=-0{,}25\"></span>. </p></center>","title":"Решение","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"solution:1"}],"schema_version":3,"problem_reference_ids":{"prototype_problem_id":null,"group_parent_problem_id":null,"adjacent_group_parent_problem_id":null}}}
